er","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-02T17:00:47Z","updated_at":"2026-07-02T17:00:47Z","body":"I think that would be much more appropriate, especially to match what the requested feature is","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4868353978/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4869309304","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120860#issuecomment-4869309304","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120860","id":4869309304,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIjvDeA","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-02T18:29:23Z","updated_at":"2026-07-02T18:29:23Z","body":"> I don't know if there is an important reason why it wasn't exposed in the first place\r\n\r\nNo idea, but it does handily stop users shooting themselves in the foot. :grin: \r\n\r\nErasing directories and their contents in one command is a pretty potent weapon (I don't think the OS offers this directly).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4869309304/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4869627100","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120860#issuecomment-4869627100","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120860","id":4869627100,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIkCc3A","user":{"login":"bluebirdsan","id":60063904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDYzOTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60063904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan","html_url":"https://github.com/bluebirdsan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-02T19:09:52Z","updated_at":"2026-07-02T19:12:37Z","body":"I agree, that it would be better to have `remove_recursive` and `remove_recursive_absolute`.\r\nOnly exposing the `erase_contents_recursive` would still require multiple steps to remove the directory with all it's contents.\r\nI think it should be a one function thing (should work like if you'd select a folder in a file explorer and hit delete - removes the selected folder with all its contents).\r\n\r\n> Erasing directories and their contents in one command is a pretty potent weapon (I don't think the OS offers this directly).\r\n\r\nI think if this is split into two commands (remove contents and then the directory) then it isn't that much different, because if you remove contents first, you already lost everything useful inside, so the one command thing would just be more convenient :D  +  if anyone would pass a path without checking, if they should remove it, then they're just looking for trouble anyway.\r\n\r\nEDIT: I also think that most people would use this function on \"user://\" paths, which at most would break the game and not the whole system.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4869627100/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4877988555","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120860#issuecomment-4877988555","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120860","id":4877988555,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIsAyyw","user":{"login":"Elip100","id":173850307,"node_id":"U_kgDOCly-ww","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/173850307?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elip100","html_url":"https://github.com/Elip100","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elip100/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elip100/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elip100/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elip100/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elip100/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elip100/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elip100/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elip100/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elip100/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-03T16:22:07Z","updated_at":"2026-07-03T16:22:07Z","body":"> it does handily stop users shooting themselves in the foot. :grin: \n> \n> \n> \n> Erasing directories and their contents in one command is a pretty potent weapon (I don't think the OS offers this directly).\n\nIt would pretty much be the Godot equivalent of `rm -rf`. I personally don't think we should be avoiding a feature like this just because it could break stuff if used incorrectly. I would say that it is the programmer's fault for blindly using a method they don't understand the risks of. We could always add a warning to the documentation if we want to.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4877988555/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4878078076","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120860#issuecomment-4878078076","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120860","id":4878078076,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIsGQfA","user":{"login":"Elip100","id":173850307,"node_id":"U_kgDOCly-ww","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/173850307?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elip100","html_url":"https://github.com/Elip100","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elip100/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elip100/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.gith